# Queue: one follow-up queued, then Esc while the turn is still busy.
# Esc-while-busy interrupts the running turn (internal/tui/keys.go's
# Interrupt binding) rather than touching the already-queued follow-up,
# and internal/tui/app.go's finishTurn commits "■ Interrupted. Tell kiln
# what to do instead." once the aborted turn unwinds.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/queue-busy.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT welcome
TYPE start the rate limiter work
KEY enter
WAITFOR /esc to stop/ 10
SHOT busy
TYPE also check the login route
KEY enter
SHOT queued-one
EXPECT /1 queued/
KEY esc
WAITFOR /Interrupted/ 20
SHOT after-esc
EXPECT /Interrupted/
EXPECT /also check the login route/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
